{"id":72179,"date":"2026-11-01T19:12:02","date_gmt":"2026-11-01T19:12:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72179"},"modified":"2026-11-01T20:20:51","modified_gmt":"2026-11-01T19:20:51","slug":"maratona-de-cidade-do-cabo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-cidade-do-cabo\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027<\/strong> (<em>Sanlam Cape Town Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>22 e 23 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, com a prova rainha dos <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> agendada para a manh\u00e3 de domingo, <strong>23 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, na deslumbrante metr\u00f3pole da <strong>Cidade do Cabo, \u00c1frica do Sul<\/strong>. A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 assinala um marco hist\u00f3rico no atletismo mundial: ap\u00f3s superar com distin\u00e7\u00e3o a segunda fase de avalia\u00e7\u00e3o em maio de 2026, a prova estreia-se oficialmente como o <strong>8\u00ba membro das Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/strong> e a <strong>primeira Major de sempre realizada no continente africano<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida na <strong>Fritz Sonnenberg Road<\/strong> e chegada junto ao ic\u00f3nico <strong>DHL Stadium em Green Point<\/strong>, o percurso homologado de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> (tempo limite de <strong>6 horas e 30 minutos<\/strong>) combina vistas panor\u00e2micas sobre o Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico em Sea Point com o cen\u00e1rio monumental da <strong>Table Mountain<\/strong>, passando pelos principais marcos hist\u00f3ricos e culturais da chamada <em>Mother City<\/em>. O programa de s\u00e1bado, <strong>22 de maio<\/strong>, integra as populares corridas de estrada <strong>Peace Run de 10 km e 5 km<\/strong>, bem como as exigentes provas de montanha do <strong>Cape Town Trail Marathon (43 km, 22 km e 11 km)<\/strong> nos trilhos do Parque Nacional da Table Mountain.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada sob a \u00e9gide da <strong>Western Province Athletics<\/strong>, <strong>Athletics South Africa<\/strong> e <strong>ASEM Running<\/strong> com o patroc\u00ednio principal da Sanlam, a prova atribui a cobi\u00e7ada estrela oficial no caminho para a <em>Six Star \/ Nine Star Finisher<\/em> das AbbottWMM. Ap\u00f3s o encerramento do sorteio geral (<em>Ballot<\/em>) para os 42,2 km, os atletas internacionais e portugueses podem garantir dorsal oficial atrav\u00e9s dos <strong>Operadores Tur\u00edsticos Internacionais Oficiais (ITO)<\/strong> \u2014 incluindo ag\u00eancias acreditadas para a Pen\u00ednsula Ib\u00e9rica \u2014 ou atrav\u00e9s dos programas solid\u00e1rios oficiais (<em>Run for Charity<\/em>). Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">23 de Maio de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Cidade do Cabo, \u00c1frica do Sul<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona 42,195 km, Peace Runs (10 km e 5 km) e Cape Town Trail (43 km, 22 km e 11 km)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sanlam Cape Town Marathon \/ Western Province Athletics e ASEM Running<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h30m (Maratona 42,195 km)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tipo de Piso<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Asfalto urbano costeiro (Maratona e Peace Runs) e trilhos na Table Mountain (Trail)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Perfil & Relevo<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">R\u00e1pido e maioritariamente plano junto \u00e0 orla atl\u00e2ntica de Green Point e Sea Point<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/capetownmarathon.com\/international-travel-program\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Sanlam Cape Town Marathon 42,2 Km (Abbott World Marathon Major)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 06:15<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Abastecimentos a cada 2,5 km + meta<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Sorteio Internacional (Ballot) \/ ITO:<\/strong> 160,00 USD<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Via Ballot ou Operadores Oficiais)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Peace Run 10 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 07:00<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Postos interm\u00e9dios + meta<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 330 ZAR<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 esgotar vagas)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Peace Run 5 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:15<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Abastecimento na meta<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 170 ZAR<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 esgotar vagas)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Cape Town Trail Marathon (43 Km \/ 22 Km \/ 11 Km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 06:00<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Postos de montanha + meta<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Trail 11 km \/ 22 km \/ 43 km:<\/strong> 450 a 1450 ZAR<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 esgotar vagas)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O fim de semana da Sanlam Cape Town Marathon decorre a 22 e 23 de maio de 2027 na Cidade do Cabo, \u00c1frica do Sul. As provas Peace Run (10 km e 5 km) e o Cape Town Trail (43 km, 22 km e 11 km) realizam-se no s\u00e1bado, 22 de maio, enquanto a Maratona principal de 42,195 km parte na manh\u00e3 de domingo, 23 de maio de 2027.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027 faz parte das Abbott World Marathon Majors?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. Confirmada oficialmente em junho de 2026 ap\u00f3s aprovar a segunda fase de avalia\u00e7\u00e3o, a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 estreia a Maratona da Cidade do Cabo como a 8\u00aa prova do circuito Abbott World Marathon Majors e a primeira Major da hist\u00f3ria no continente africano.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para atletas portugueses e internacionais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O acesso \u00e0 Maratona de 42,195 km faz-se atrav\u00e9s do sorteio oficial (Ballot, encerrado em junho de 2026) ou com dorsal garantido atrav\u00e9s do Programa Internacional de Operadores Tur\u00edsticos Oficiais (ITO \u2014 que conta com operadores acreditados em Portugal e Espanha, como a Endeavor Maratones e a Travelmarathon) e de vagas solid\u00e1rias (Run for Charity).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 a partida e chegada e qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da maratona?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida e a chegada situam-se no complexo desportivo de Green Point, junto ao DHL Stadium (Fritz Sonnenberg Road \/ Beach Road), na Cidade do Cabo. O tempo limite oficial para concluir os 42,195 km \u00e9 de 6 horas e 30 minutos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que outras dist\u00e2ncias integram o evento al\u00e9m dos 42,195 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Al\u00e9m da maratona de estrada no domingo, o programa de s\u00e1bado inclui duas corridas urbanas abertas a todos os ritmos \u2014 a Peace Run 10 km e a Peace Run 5 km \u2014 e tr\u00eas provas de trail running nas encostas da Table Mountain e Signal Hill: Trail Marathon de 43 km, Trail de 22 km e Trail de 11 km.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-23\", \"endDate\": \"2027-05-23\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cidade do Cabo, \u00c1frica do Sul\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Cidade do Cabo\", \"addressRegion\": \"\u00c1frica do Sul\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027 realiza-se a 23 de maio na \u00c1frica do Sul. Estreia da 1\u00aa World Marathon Major em \u00c1frica (42,2 km, 10 km e Trail). Inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-maratona-de-cidade-do-cabo.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/capetownmarathon.com\/\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Sanlam Cape Town Marathon \/ Western Province Athletics e ASEM Running\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O fim de semana da Sanlam Cape Town Marathon decorre a 22 e 23 de maio de 2027 na Cidade do Cabo, \u00c1frica do Sul. As provas Peace Run (10 km e 5 km) e o Cape Town Trail (43 km, 22 km e 11 km) realizam-se no s\u00e1bado, 22 de maio, enquanto a Maratona principal de 42,195 km parte na manh\u00e3 de domingo, 23 de maio de 2027.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A Maratona de Cidade do Cabo 2027 faz parte das Abbott World Marathon Majors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. Confirmada oficialmente em junho de 2026 ap\u00f3s aprovar a segunda fase de avalia\u00e7\u00e3o, a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 estreia a Maratona da Cidade do Cabo como a 8\u00aa prova do circuito Abbott World Marathon Majors e a primeira Major da hist\u00f3ria no continente africano.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para atletas portugueses e internacionais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O acesso \u00e0 Maratona de 42,195 km faz-se atrav\u00e9s do sorteio oficial (Ballot, encerrado em junho de 2026) ou com dorsal garantido atrav\u00e9s do Programa Internacional de Operadores Tur\u00edsticos Oficiais (ITO \u2014 que conta com operadores acreditados em Portugal e Espanha, como a Endeavor Maratones e a Travelmarathon) e de vagas solid\u00e1rias (Run for Charity).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 a partida e chegada e qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida e a chegada situam-se no complexo desportivo de Green Point, junto ao DHL Stadium (Fritz Sonnenberg Road \/ Beach Road), na Cidade do Cabo. O tempo limite oficial para concluir os 42,195 km \u00e9 de 6 horas e 30 minutos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que outras dist\u00e2ncias integram o evento al\u00e9m dos 42,195 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Al\u00e9m da maratona de estrada no domingo, o programa de s\u00e1bado inclui duas corridas urbanas abertas a todos os ritmos \u2014 a Peace Run 10 km e a Peace Run 5 km \u2014 e tr\u00eas provas de trail running nas encostas da Table Mountain e Signal Hill: Trail Marathon de 43 km, Trail de 22 km e Trail de 11 km.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72181,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,478,31,41],"event_type_2":[1409,1410],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[1096],"class_list":["post-72179","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-maratona","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-africa","event_type_2-africa-do-sul","event_type_5-majors"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-maratona-de-cidade-do-cabo.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72179","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=72179"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72179\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":72182,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72179\/revisions\/72182"}],"wp:featuredm